  <description>
    <p
        >JoeQuake is a custom Quake engine designed exclusively for speedrunning, based on
    the official id software GLQuake source code.</p>
    <p
        >JoeQuake features a number of improvements over the vanilla GLQuake client, such as:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Independent server-client physics</li>
        <li>Ghost mode recording</li>
        <li>Browsable Demos/Maps/Mods menus</li>
        <li>Restructured, more detailed Options menu</li>
        <li>Mouse cursor in menu</li>
        <li>Supporting FitzQuake and RMQ protocols</li>
        <li
            >Supporting a wide range of custom mods (including Quake remastered)</li>
        <li>Colored static and dynamic lighting</li>
        <li>External texture formats (TGA/PNG/JPG)</li>
        <li>Capturing demos to AVI file</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
